        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The table below gives information about the population of people aged 60 and over in six regions in 2000 and the predicted figures for 2050. It also shows the world total of people aged 60 and over in 2000 and 2050. Summarise the information by selecting ",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong>The table below gives information about the population of people aged 60 and over in six regions in 2000 and the predicted figures for 2050. It also shows the world total of people aged 60 and over in 2000 and 2050. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Global Elderly Population Projections</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WzbldxsHvoEmSdxHZSalPqZUg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ phần trăm d&acirc;n số người cao tuổi (60 tuổi trở l&ecirc;n) tại s&aacute;u khu vực kh&aacute;c nhau tr&ecirc;n thế giới trong hai mốc thời gian: 2000 v&agrave; 2050.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLFYdUG36o4o85xAOPBlI161gNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UEs9dlyx2okrTPxmScBl9NDNgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: <strong>Tỷ lệ người cao tuổi - 6 khu vực + to&agrave;n cầu - 2000 v&agrave; 2050.</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UEs9dlyx2okrTPxmScBl9NDNgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho tất cả c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng Table ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr; <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\"><a class=\"underline\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/170/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570?collection=lesson&amp;item=2\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng Table</a></span></span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BPLHdZ1AWonL9Zx1HAklrflQgAd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrEfdeA32oruHJxpv0CltBnPg7d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FCkCdAPs9oUNGVxxTwhlgylYgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề bảng số liệu, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GZcTdNWcioGBaOxgDeKlQrMrgth\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends:</strong> Tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số cao tuổi dự kiến sẽ tăng ở tất cả c&aacute;c khu vực trong khoảng thời gian 50 năm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RWLpdM2ueoHPDSxiyNelDqmkg2b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences:</strong> Europe lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số cao tuổi cao nhất trong cả hai năm, trong khi Asia được dự b&aacute;o sẽ c&oacute; mức tăng tuyệt đối đ&aacute;ng kể nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pi8FdlqEUoy6aGxXSiglpGrIgeh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c khu vực c&oacute; tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số cao tuổi ban đầu cao hơn (&ge;11%)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IrAwd9JxtorDimxNXDOlx9MTgjb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ka8gdthPyon2M7xvXaulCd6vgHd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1)<strong> M&ocirc; tả Europe - khu vực c&oacute; tỷ lệ cao nhất </strong><em>(22% năm 2000, tăng l&ecirc;n 31% năm 2050)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GiFudogmMoLAGmxQeRuldWCAgGh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả Asia, North America v&agrave; Oceania - nh&oacute;m c&oacute; tỷ lệ trung b&igrave;nh</strong> <em>(Asia: 12% tăng l&ecirc;n 28%; North America: 11% tăng l&ecirc;n 26%; Oceania: 11% tăng l&ecirc;n 22%)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KIQYdLDNloaVCxxoOylll30rgZg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>Nhấn mạnh Asia c&oacute; mức tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i ấn tượng nhất trong nh&oacute;m n&agrave;y</strong> <em>(từ 12% l&ecirc;n 28%)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjNPd6TvCoVV5Hxq9TQlhCehgNb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BbzKdPgEyoLpsjx7kYIlQ0Q1g4g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0l8dkGHhoeVf1xdcuPlhdbRgHd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YFozdR2IuosAukxF4wqlDPA0gnh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: C&aacute;c khu vực c&oacute; tỷ lệ ban đầu thấp hơn (&lt;11%) + Whole world</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZFQdbZvYoA2RXxrWTdlYAEJgtc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NP9zdmbXAotGcsxlmHslLtUbgBh\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả Latin America v&agrave; Africa - nh&oacute;m c&oacute; tỷ lệ thấp</strong> <em>(Latin America: 7% năm 2000; Africa: 5% năm 2000)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M9R1dr3CaoE5A8xS2wMlG5WogJg\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự tăng trưởng của cả hai khu vực</strong> <em>(Latin America tăng hơn gấp đ&ocirc;i l&ecirc;n 18%; Africa tăng gần 2.5 lần l&ecirc;n 12%)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M9R1dr3CaoE5A8xS2wMlG5WogJg\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3) <strong>Kết th&uacute;c với dữ liệu to&agrave;n cầu</strong> <em>(13% năm 2000 tăng l&ecirc;n 24% năm 2050)</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RYRddABRToQrqNxG0fSl7OrOg5c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdvRdtEEMoe1nqxSg4NlhL6GgQf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WIUnd6WAUoXWJSx4xA3lyHevgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GzVudZspKo0jPLxbMunl1LTAgjc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>người cao tuổi</strong>\", thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>elderly people</strong>\", m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể paraphrase th&agrave;nh&nbsp;<strong>\"senior citizens\" / \"elderly individuals\" / \"people aged 60 or older\"</strong>&nbsp;để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuK9dgT5AoBU6KxgM0plA894gId\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NvYsd4I6NoNXSxxNnTolfHG5gee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YbR8dyQxAoaG29xE7KhliRkPgwr\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\"The percentage of elderly individuals was 13% in 2000.\"</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Es2sdYkRHorOOtxMK3plMsnvgab\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\"The proportion of senior citizens is expected to rise.\"</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2643,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The table presents data on the percentage of elderly people aged 60 or older in six different regions, along with the global figure, in 2000, with forecasts for 2050.</p>",
            "question_id": 24941,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2644,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the proportion of senior citizens is expected to rise in all regions over the 50-year period. Additionally, Europe consistently had the highest elderly population, while Asia is projected to experience the most substantial absolute growth.</p>",
            "question_id": 24941,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2645,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Beginning with regions that had higher elderly populations initially, Europe recorded the highest figure at 22% in 2000, followed by Asia and North America at 12% and 11%, respectively, with Oceania at a similar level of 11%. By 2050, Europe's proportion is forecast to increase to 31%, maintaining its leading position. Meanwhile, Asia is expected to see the most dramatic rise among these regions, more than doubling to 28%, while North America's figure is projected to reach 26%. Oceania is also anticipated to double, ending at 22%.</p>",
            "question_id": 24941,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2646,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>As for regions with lower starting percentages, Latin America stood at 7% in 2000, while Africa had the smallest proportion at just 5%. Over the following five decades, Latin America's figure is predicted to more than double to 18%, whereas Africa's is expected to increase nearly two-and-a-half-fold to 12%. Finally, the worldwide percentage of elderly individuals was 13% in 2000 and is forecast to rise to 24% by 2050.</p>",
            "question_id": 24941,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
        "writing_graph_image": "b9df2504-1b00-4202-bddd-fb7b9464a76d",
        "writing_graph_description": "1/ Chart Description:\n\nChart type: Table\nTitle: The table below gives information about the population of people aged 60 and over in six regions in 2000 and the predicted figures for 2050. It also shows the world total of people aged 60 and over in 2000 and 2050.\nTime period: 2000 and 2050\nUnits: Percentages (%)\nAxes: N/A (table format)\nCategories/Groups: Africa, North America, Europe, Asia, Latin America, Oceania, Whole world\n\n2/ Data in CSV format:\nRegion,2000,2050\nAfrica,5%,12%\nNorth America,11%,26%\nEurope,22%,31%\nAsia,12%,28%\nLatin America,7%,18%\nOceania,11%,22%\nWhole world,13%,24%",
